Package: dspacer
Title: Retrieve Metadata and Text from DSpace Repositories
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Thomas", "Hegghammer", , "code@hegghammer.net", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6253-1518"))
Description: A read-only client for the modern DSpace REST API. Retrieve item
    metadata without discarding repeated or custom fields, inventory and
    download attachments, and convert selected Markdown files to plaintext
    for computational research. Supports anonymous and password-authenticated
    access without assuming a particular repository schema or language.
